  Group 2 is the shared Helix scaffold keys the web `AIFeatureCard` / `AiOutputPanel` / `AIBadge`
  resolve (the universal "Ask Helix" CTA, the thinking label, the badge tooltip, the error label).

  Group 3 backs the native chrome — the proposal summary labels, the P4 leaf freshness / loading /
  empty / error copy — so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

